{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:08.42]Cold\n[00:09.92](Special Request)\n[00:11.70]Ain't nothin' but a—\n[00:12.68]Uh, no-good bad woman\n[00:16.94]Yeah, huh, no-good, diamond-watchin' woman\n[00:20.76]Uh\n[00:20.84](\n[00:20.90]Hey, Rvssian\n[00:21.44])\n[Chorus]\n[00:21.50]She ain't nothin' but a no-good, diamond-watchin' woman\n[00:24.76]Only love me 'cause she see Versace on my linens\n[00:27.52]Baby, I'm not God, so your sins are not forgiven\n[00:30.48]I can never lose, every day I wake up winnin'\n[00:32.80]Mama told me, \"Cut the bad hoes off with the scissors\"\n[00:36.02]Make 'em disappear, call me Juice WRLD wizard, uh\n[00:38.62]Bae, I'm high off narcotics, so your name, I cannot remember\n[00:41.36]Using opiates overly, openly fuckin' up my image, yeah\n[Verse 1]\n[00:45.52]Uh, one thing you need to know about me is\n[00:48.04]All I ever wanted was love and money, yeah\n[00:51.24]One thing you need to know about me is\n[00:53.62]This rock star life turned me to a junkie\n[00:56.56]Uh, another thing you need to know about me is\n[00:59.22]I'm full of addictions, decisions vindictive\n[01:01.92]Subject a lil' sensitive, maybe I should just shallow it\n[01:04.78]Went from talkin' depression to money-makin' prerogative (Yeah)\n[01:08.06]Still a smart guy, could've got a scholarship\n[01:10.56]Said fuck college, I'ma tell you how I started it\n[01:13.26]It took one phone call from G-Money, that's my dog\n[01:15.84]Turned me from a twenty-dollar nigga to millions in my drawers\n[01:19.06]This song's about all my talents and vices (Oh, oh)\n[01:21.94]Listen repeatedly, scream it, recite it (Oh, oh)\n[01:24.54]Until it piss your father off, he already pissed though (Oh, oh)\n[01:27.56]I know 'cause his daughter on my tour givin' deep throat (Oh, oh)\n[01:30.34]This song's about all my talents and vices (Oh, oh)\n[01:33.24]Listen repeatedly, scream it, recite it (Oh, oh)\n[01:36.04]Your girl give me fellatio, you should be excited (Oh, oh)\n[01:38.62]'Cause when she come back to you, that's a million-dollar nut kiss (Oh, oh, mwah)\n[Chorus]\n[01:41.32]She ain't nothin' but a no-good, diamond-watchin' woman\n[01:43.84]Only love me 'cause she see Versace on my linens\n[01:46.58]Baby, I'm not God, so your sins are not forgiven\n[01:49.54]I can never lose, every day I wake up winnin'\n[01:51.88]Mama told me, \"Cut the bad hoes off with the scissors\"\n[01:55.08]Make 'em disappear, call me Juice WRLD wizard, uh\n[01:57.82]Bae, I'm high off narcotics, so your name, I cannot remember\n[02:00.42]Using opiates overly, openly fuckin' up my image, yeah\n[Post-Chorus]\n[02:04.46]I grew up on all types\n[02:06.92]I'm talkin' 'bout music and girls, right?\n[02:10.14]I grew up on all types\n[02:12.56]I'm talkin' 'bout drugs, the weed and the pills\n[02:15.78]I grew up on all types\n[02:18.18]I'm talkin' 'bout music and hoes, right?\n[02:20.96]And clothes\n[02:21.76]I was overly exposed\n[02:22.94]Now I'm bearin' the fruits my mama planted, they done growed\n[Verse 2]\n[02:25.82]Hell yeah, they done glowed up, I done glowed up\n[02:28.62]Oxycodone got me sewed up, gotta remain focused\n[02:31.50]And these groupie hoes bogus, everybody knows it\n[02:34.22]But they turn me to a poet with the love commotion\n[02:37.02]Blood, sweat, and tears, money parted it, Moses\n[02:39.90]Used to roll mid, now it's gas what I'm smokin' (What I'm smokin')\n[02:42.90]Like I farted, hit the gas, I'm in motion (I'm in motion)\n[02:45.66]I departed\n[02:46.58]Wrist hangin' out the window, cost your apartment\n[02:49.74]This the brightest that my life ever been\n[02:51.94]I need diamonds all over for when it get dark again\n[02:54.70]Called my mama up and told her that the devil marchin' in\n[02:57.34]She sent me Bible verses\n[02:58.60]Then I got distracted by some nudes from a sex worker\n[03:01.42]Who am I to not text back? That's networking\n[03:04.42]Who am I to lie about my life? I know the truth hurts (Truth hurts)\n[03:13.08]Who am I to say that this ain't one of my best verses?\n[03:54.60]Uh-oh, too bad that it's over (Over)\n[Chorus]\n[04:32.26]She ain't nothin' but a no-good, diamond-watchin' woman\n[05:07.14]Only love me 'cause she see Versace on my linens\n[05:09.88]Baby, I'm not God, so your sins are not forgiven\n[05:12.84]I can never lose, every day I wake up winnin'\n[05:15.16]Mama told me, \"Cut the bad hoes off with the scissors\"\n[05:18.36]Make 'em disappear, call me Juice WRLD wizard, uh\n[05:20.96]Bae, I'm high off narcotics, so your name, I cannot remember\n[05:23.72]Using opiates overly, openly fuckin' up my image, yeah\n[Post-Chorus]\n[05:39.08]I grew up on all types\n[05:41.48]I'm talkin' 'bout music and girls, right?\n[05:44.26]I grew up on all types\n[05:47.58]I'm talkin' 'bout drugs, the weed and the pills\n[06:00.72]I grew up on all types\n[06:02.56]I'm talkin' 'bout music and hoes, right?\n[06:05.42]Now I'm bearin' the fruits my mama planted, they done growed\n[Outro]\n[06:09.20]Uh-huh, uh-huh\n[06:10.10]Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh","words":[[8.42,8.88,"Cold"],[9.92,10.4,"(Special"],[10.44,11.64,"Request)"],[11.7,11.96,"Ain't"],[12.02,12.32,"nothin'"],[12.36,12.52,"but"],[12.6,12.6,"a—"],[12.68,12.7,"Uh,"],[14.14,14.76,"no-good"],[14.82,14.9,"bad"],[15.16,16.9,"woman"],[16.94,17.04,"Yeah,"],[17.14,17.2,"huh,"],[17.26,17.56,"no-good,"],[17.62,18.3,"diamond-watchin'"],[18.36,18.7,"woman"],[20.76,20.82,"Uh"],[20.84,20.86,"("],[20.9,20.94,"Hey,"],[21.06,21.42,"Rvssian"],[21.44,21.46,")"],[21.5,21.6,"She"],[21.68,21.84,"ain't"],[21.92,22.24,"nothin'"],[22.28,22.42,"but"],[22.48,22.48,"a"],[22.6,23.24,"no-good,"],[23.28,23.96,"diamond-watchin'"],[24.02,24.34,"woman"],[24.76,24.94,"Only"],[25.06,25.12,"love"],[25.22,25.24,"me"],[25.34,25.52,"'cause"],[25.56,25.62,"she"],[25.74,25.88,"see"],[25.92,26.36,"Versace"],[26.54,26.58,"on"],[26.64,26.66,"my"],[26.82,27.22,"linens"],[27.52,27.8,"Baby,"],[27.84,28.02,"I'm"],[28.06,28.16,"not"],[28.24,28.48,"God,"],[28.58,28.64,"so"],[28.76,28.88,"your"],[28.92,29.12,"si